---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Hastelloy B2" active="/products">
  <section class="pagebanner">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--blue)">High Nickel Alloys</p>
      <h1>Hastelloy B2</h1>
      <p>Severe-service nickel alloy from Bhansali Metals — full forms stocked with MTC and third-party inspection.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="visual">
    <img src="/product-hastelloy.webp" alt="Hastelloy B2 product photography" />
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell productcontent">
      <aside>Bhansali Metals<br />Product briefing</aside>
      <div>
<h3>Hastelloy B2</h3>
<p>Hastelloy B2 is a solid-solution-strengthened nickel-molybdenum alloy with significant resistance to reducing environments — hydrogen chloride gas and sulfuric, acetic and phosphoric acids. Molybdenum, the primary alloying element, delivers that resistance, and the alloy suits as-welded use since it resists grain-boundary carbide precipitates in the heat-affected zone.</p>
<p>It resists hydrochloric acid at all concentrations and temperatures, plus pitting, stress-corrosion cracking and knife-line/HAZ attack — and handles pure sulfuric acid and many non-oxidising acids.</p>
<h3>Forms stocked at Bhansali Metals</h3>
        <div class="details">
        <div>
          <b>Sheet</b>
          <span>Sheet in Hastelloy B2</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Plate</b>
          <span>Plate in Hastelloy B2</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Pipe & Tube (welded and seamless)</b>
          <span>Pipe & Tube (welded and seamless) in Hastelloy B2</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Wire</b>
          <span>Wire in Hastelloy B2</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Bar</b>
          <span>Bar in Hastelloy B2</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Fittings</b>
          <span>Fittings in Hastelloy B2</span>
        </div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:2rem">
          <a class="button" href="/enquiry">Request a quote ↗</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
